},{"w":"I","s":16.555,"e":16.795},{"w":"resent","s":16.795,"e":17.115},{"w":"the","s":17.115,"e":17.355},{"w":"implication","s":17.355,"e":17.915},{"w":"that","s":17.915,"e":18.155},{"w":"a","s":18.155,"e":18.315},{"w":"snack","s":18.315,"e":18.635},{"w":"could","s":18.635,"e":18.875},{"w":"outsmart","s":18.875,"e":19.355},{"w":"me.","s":19.355,"e":19.915}]},{"speaker":"Alice","start":20.155,"end":29,"text":"Oh, this is going to be delicious, because I watched you buy the large popcorn, and I am fairly certain you did exactly what the cinema wanted you to do.","words":[{"w":"Oh,","s":20.155,"e":20.715},{"w":"this","s":20.715,"e":21.035},{"w":"is","s":21.035,"e":21.195},{"w":"going","s":21.195,"e":21.435},{"w":"to","s":21.435,"e":21.595},{"w":"be","s":21.595,"e":21.755},{"w":"delicious,","s":21.755,"e":22.395},{"w":"because","s":22.395,"e":22.715},{"w":"I","s":22.715,"e":22.955},{"w":"watched","s":22.955,"e":23.275},{"w":"you","s":23.275,"e":23.435},{"w":"buy","s":23.435,"e":23.675},{"w":"the","s":23.675,"e":23.835},{"w":"large","s":23.835,"e":24.155},{"w":"popcorn,","s":24.155,"e":24.715},{"w":"and","s":24.84,"e":25.08},{"w":"I","s":25.08,"e":25.24},{"w":"am","s":25.24,"e":25.48},{"w":"fairly","s":25.48,"e":25.8},{"w":"certain","s":25.8,"e":26.12},{"w":"you","s":26.12,"e":26.36},{"w":"did","s":26.36,"e":26.6},{"w":"exactly","s":26.6,"e":27.08},{"w":"what","s":27.08,"e":27.24},{"w":"the","s":27.24,"e":27.4},{"w":"cinema","s":27.4,"e":27.8},{"w":"wanted","s":27.8,"e":28.2},{"w":"you","s":28.2,"e":28.44},{"w":"to","s":28.44,"e":28.52},{"w":"do.","s":28.52,"e":29}]},{"speaker":"David","start":29.24,"end":38.04,"text":"No, no, I did the maths, thank you very much. The medium cost nearly as much as the large, so the large was obviously the smarter, more rational purchase.","words":[{"w":"No,","s":29.24,"e":29.72},{"w":"no,","s":29.72,"e":29.96},{"w":"I","s":29.96,"e":30.12},{"w":"did","s":30.12,"e":30.28},{"w":"the","s":30.28,"e":30.44},{"w":"maths,","s":30.44,"e":31},{"w":"thank","s":31,"e":31.24},{"w":"you","s":31.24,"e":31.4},{"w":"very","s":31.4,"e":31.56},{"w":"much.","s":31.56,"e":32.04},{"w":"The","s":32.28,"e":32.52},{"w":"medium","s":32.52,"e":32.92},{"w":"cost","s":32.92,"e":33.24},{"w":"nearly","s":33.24,"e":33.64},{"w":"as","s":33.64,"e":33.8},{"w":"much","s":33.8,"e":33.96},{"w":"as","s":33.96,"e":34.12},{"w":"the","s":34.12,"e":34.28},{"w":"large,","s":34.28,"e":34.84},{"w":"so","s":34.84,"e":35.16},{"w":"the","s":35.16,"e":35.32},{"w":"large","s":35.32,"e":35.56},{"w":"was","s":35.56,"e":35.8},{"w":"obviously","s":35.8,"e":36.28},{"w":"the","s":36.28,"e":36.52},{"w":"smarter,","s":36.52,"e":37.08},{"w":"more","s":37.08,"e":37.24},{"w":"rational","s":37.24,"e":37.64},{"w":"purchase.","s":37.64,"e":38.04}]},{"speaker":"Alice","start":38.575,"end":48.575,"text":"Exactly, and that tiny gap between medium and large is not an accident, my friend. Somebody in an office designed that gap so your brain would do that little dance.","words":[{"w":"Exactly,","s":38.575,"e":39.455},{"w":"and","s":39.455,"e":39.775},{"w":"that","s":39.775,"e":39.935},{"w":"tiny","s":39.935,"e":40.415},{"w":"gap","s":40.415,"e":40.735},{"w":"between","s":40.735,"e":41.055},{"w":"medium","s":41.055,"e":41.535},{"w":"and","s":41.535,"e":41.775},{"w":"large","s":41.775,"e":42.095},{"w":"is","s":42.095,"e":42.335},{"w":"not","s":42.335,"e":42.575},{"w":"an","s":42.575,"e":42.735},{"w":"accident,","s":42.735,"e":43.375},{"w":"my","s":43.375,"e":43.455},{"w":"friend.","s":43.455,"e":44.015},{"w":"Somebody","s":44.095,"e":44.495},{"w":"in","s":44.495,"e":44.735},{"w":"an","s":44.735,"e":44.895},{"w":"office","s":44.895,"e":45.215},{"w":"designed","s":45.215,"e":45.695},{"w":"that","s":45.695,"e":46.015},{"w":"gap","s":46.015,"e":46.255},{"w":"so","s":46.255,"e":46.575},{"w":"your","s":46.575,"e":46.735},{"w":"brain","s":46.735,"e":47.055},{"w":"would","s":47.055,"e":47.295},{"w":"do","s":47.295,"e":47.455},{"w":"that","s":47.455,"e":47.695},{"w":"little","s":47.695,"e":48.015},{"w":"dance.","s":48.015,"e":48.575}]},{"speaker":"David","start":49.055,"end":58.37,"text":"Hold on. Are you seriously telling me the medium popcorn exists purely as bait? That someone printed a size onto the menu they never actually intend to sell?","words":[{"w":"Hold","s":49.055,"e":49.295},{"w":"on.","s":49.295,"e":49.855},{"w":"Are","s":49.855,"e":50.095},{"w":"you","s":50.095,"e":50.255},{"w":"seriously","s":50.255,"e":50.815},{"w":"telling","s":50.815,"e":51.135},{"w":"me","s":51.135,"e":51.295},{"w":"the","s":51.295,"e":51.535},{"w":"medium","s":51.535,"e":51.935},{"w":"popcorn","s":51.935,"e":52.495},{"w":"exists","s":52.495,"e":52.895},{"w":"purely","s":52.895,"e":53.375},{"w":"as","s":53.375,"e":53.535},{"w":"bait?","s":53.535,"e":53.935},{"w":"That","s":53.97,"e":54.29},{"w":"someone","s":54.29,"e":54.77},{"w":"printed","s":54.77,"e":55.09},{"w":"a","s":55.09,"e":55.33},{"w":"size","s":55.33,"e":55.57},{"w":"onto","s":55.57,"e":55.89},{"w":"the","s":55.89,"e":56.05},{"w":"menu","s":56.05,"e":56.37},{"w":"they","s":56.37,"e":56.61},{"w":"never","s":56.61,"e":56.93},{"w":"actually","s":56.93,"e":57.25},{"w":"intend","s":57.25,"e":57.73},{"w":"to","s":57.73,"e":57.81},{"w":"sell?","s":57.81,"e":58.37}]},{"speaker":"Alice","start":58.69,"end":66.13,"text":"That is precisely what I am telling you. It is called the decoy effect. The medium exists purely to make the large look reasonable.","words":[{"w":"That","s":58.69,"e":58.93},{"w":"is","s":58.93,"e":59.17},{"w":"precisely","s":59.17,"e":59.73},{"w":"what","s":59.73,"e":59.97},{"w":"I","s":59.97,"e":60.21},{"w":"am","s":60.21,"e":60.37},{"w":"telling","s":60.37,"e":60.61},{"w":"you.","s":60.61,"e":61.01},{"w":"It","s":61.01,"e":61.33},{"w":"is","s":61.33,"e":61.49},{"w":"called","s":61.49,"e":61.73},{"w":"the","s":61.73,"e":61.97},{"w":"decoy","s":61.97,"e":62.45},{"w":"effect.","s":62.45,"e":63.17},{"w":"The","s":63.17,"e":63.33},{"w":"medium","s":63.33,"e":63.73},{"w":"exists","s":6